        "note_tweet": {
          "text": "I brought my sound recorder to a singing/vocal lesson.\n\nI had a few extra tokens to spare, so decided to give the recording to my main bot, and see if he could do something with it.\n\nIt transcribed at analyzed the lesson, separated the top advice/key points from the teacher, picked out the exercises for me to repeat at home, and even produced pitch graphs with how accurate my singing was through the lesson.\n\nI think I’ve found my new use case! 🎤👨‍🎤"
